# Build-context hygiene for the reactor-root context (code/):
# keep credentials, logs, and build artifacts out of the Docker build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/logs/
**/target/
**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
**/*.log
**/.git/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
# Host-local, git-ignored build outputs (Go binaries in go-bridge/) and
# Eclipse/JDT metadata: this context is COPY-heavy (the gateway and bridge
# images take code/ wholesale), so without these the host's build outputs and
# IDE state ride into the builder context. Keep in sync with the repo-root
# .dockerignore (P5-015) — both are stamp inputs now.
**/arrow-bridge
**/faketool/faketool
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.factorypath
**/.settings/
